{"docKey":"P5919","code":"\"\"\"\nP5919. 脉冲后序右侧和 - 单调栈还原 BST + 右缘轮廓\n\n一段两两不同的正整数序列，声称是某棵二叉排序树的后序遍历。\n先校验它能否还原；能还原时，求「右缘轮廓」的强度总和——从树的\n右侧望过去，每层最后一个（最靠右的）结点强度之和；不能还原输出 -1。\n\n输入格式：\n- 单独一行，若干空格隔开的正整数（长度 m ≤ 10000，值 ≤ 1e9 且互不相同）。\n\n输出格式：\n- 能还原时输出右缘轮廓强度总和；否则输出 -1。\n\n核心思路：\n后序遍历倒着读是「根 → 右子树 → 左子树」。维护一条单调递增的栈\n（还没向左分叉的右脊）：当前值比栈顶大，就作为栈顶的右孩子入栈，\n必须落在 (栈顶, 栈顶上界) 这个开区间里；比栈顶小，就把所有比它大的\n结点弹出，最后一个弹出的是它的父亲，它作为左孩子必须大于父亲自己的\n下界。两处区间检查任一不满足即整段作废。整个过程每条边只处理一次，\nO(m) 内还原完毕，也不受树退化成链时的递归深度影响。校验通过后再用\n显式栈做一次「先右后左」的 DFS，每个深度第一次到达的结点就是该层\n最靠右的结点。\n\n时间复杂度：O(m)\n空间复杂度：O(m)\n\"\"\"\n\n# https://codefun2000.com/p/P5919\nimport io\nimport sys\n\n# @sample-start\n\"\"\"\n样例输入 1:\n3 8 6 12 15 10\n\n样例输出 1:\n37\n\"\"\"\n# @sample-end\n\n# @sample-start\n\"\"\"\n样例输入 2:\n3 10 5 8\n\n样例输出 2:\n-1\n\"\"\"\n# @sample-end\n\n# @sample-start\n\"\"\"\n样例输入 3:\n4 7 9\n\n样例输出 3:\n20\n\"\"\"\n# @sample-end\n\n\ndef run(post):\n    \"\"\"校验并求右缘轮廓和；不能还原返回 -1。\"\"\"\n    m = len(post)\n    if m == 1:\n        return post[0]\n\n    left = [-1] * m\n    right = [-1] * m\n    # 栈元素：(值, 子树取值下界, 子树取值上界, 结点下标)，\n    # 左右孩子的取值都必须落在开区间（下界, 上界）之内\n    stack = [(post[-1], 0, 1 << 62, m - 1)]\n\n    for i in range(m - 2, -1, -1):\n        v = post[i]\n        if v > stack[-1][0]:\n            # 比栈顶大：作为栈顶的右孩子\n            val, _lo, hi, p = stack[-1]\n            if v >= hi:\n                return -1\n            right[p] = i\n            stack.append((v, val, hi, i))\n        else:\n            # 比栈顶小：弹出所有更大的结点，最后弹出的就是父亲\n            parent = stack.pop()\n            while stack and stack[-1][0] > v:\n                parent = stack.pop()\n            # v 是父亲的左孩子，必须落在父亲子树的开区间下界之上\n            if v <= parent[1]:\n                return -1\n            left[parent[3]] = i\n            stack.append((v, parent[1], parent[0], i))\n\n    # 先右后左的 DFS：栈是后进先出，左孩子先入队、右孩子后入队，\n    # 每个深度第一次出栈的就是该层最靠右的结点\n    total = 0\n    visited = set()\n    work = [(m - 1, 0)]\n    while work:\n        node, depth = work.pop()\n        if depth not in visited:\n            visited.add(depth)\n            total += post[node]\n        if left[node] != -1:\n            work.append((left[node], depth + 1))\n        if right[node] != -1:\n            work.append((right[node], depth + 1))\n    return total\n\n\ndef solve():\n    post = [int(x) for x in sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()]\n    if not post:\n        return\n    print(run(post))\n\n\ndef run_tests():\n    \"\"\"运行嵌入的官方样例与边界/随机对拍用例，方便本地自测。\"\"\"\n    import random\n    from itertools import permutations\n\n    cases = [\n        # 官方样例 1：右缘 10 + 15 + 12 = 37\n        (\"3 8 6 12 15 10\\n\", \"37\"),\n        # 官方样例 2：10 落在左子树里，破坏 BST 性质\n        (\"3 10 5 8\\n\", \"-1\"),\n        # 官方样例 3：一路向左的链，右缘就是这条链\n        (\"4 7 9\\n\", \"20\"),\n        # 单结点：它自己就是全部\n        (\"5\\n\", \"5\"),\n        # 严格递增：整棵树是一条左链，右缘从底到顶全部可见\n        (\"1 2 3 4 5 6 7\\n\", \"28\"),\n        # 严格递减：整棵树是一条右链，右缘就是全链之和\n        (\"7 6 5 4 3 2 1\\n\", \"28\"),\n        # 3 挂成根 4 的左孩子后，5 再无处可挂（越 4 的上界）\n        (\"5 3 4\\n\", \"-1\"),\n        # 右孩子的孩子越过（祖父）上界：5 只能挂在 2 的右孩子上，却大于 4 的上界\n        (\"1 5 2 4\\n\", \"-1\"),\n        # 比样例 1 多一枚挂在最左下、轮廓仍与样例 1 相同\n        (\"5 6 12 15 10\\n\", \"37\"),\n        # 双结点两种次序：和都是 3\n        (\"1 2\\n\", \"3\"),\n        (\"2 1\\n\", \"3\"),\n        # 10000 长度左链（严格递增序列），O(m) 直通\n        (\" \".join(map(str, range(1, 10001))) + \"\\n\", str(sum(range(1, 10001)))),\n        # 10000 长度右链（严格递减序列）\n        (\" \".join(map(str, range(10000, 0, -1))) + \"\\n\", str(sum(range(1, 10001)))),\n    ]\n\n    for i, (inp, expected) in enumerate(cases, 1):\n        old_stdin, old_stdout = sys.stdin, sys.stdout\n        sys.stdin = io.TextIOWrapper(io.BytesIO(inp.encode(\"utf-8\")))\n        sys.stdout = io.StringIO()\n        try:\n            solve()\n            output = sys.stdout.getvalue().strip()\n        finally:\n            sys.stdin, sys.stdout = old_stdin, old_stdout\n        status = \"✓\" if output == expected else \"✗\"\n        print(f\"用例 {i}: 期望={expected}, 实际={output} {status}\")\n\n    # 随机对拍：小规模全排列穷举 + 较大规模随机抽样，\n    # 与「递归区间校验 + 递归建树求右缘」的独立实现比对\n    random.seed(20261027)\n    fails = 0\n    checked = 0\n\n    def brute(post):\n        \"\"\"递归版：区间校验通过则建树求右缘和，否则 -1。\"\"\"\n        def ok(seq, lo, hi):\n            if not seq:\n                return True\n            root = seq[-1]\n            if not (lo < root < hi):\n                return False\n            k = len(seq) - 1\n            while k > 0 and seq[k - 1] > root:\n                k -= 1\n            # 后半段 > root 是右子树，前半段 < root 是左子树\n            return ok(seq[k:-1], root, hi) and ok(seq[:k], lo, root)\n\n        if not ok(post, 0, 1 << 62):\n            return -1\n\n        def build(seq, lo, hi):\n            root = seq[-1]\n            k = len(seq) - 1\n            while k > 0 and seq[k - 1] > root:\n                k -= 1\n            left_sub = build(seq[:k], lo, root) if k else None\n            right_sub = build(seq[k:-1], root, hi) if k < len(seq) - 1 else None\n            return (root, left_sub, right_sub)\n\n        tree = build(post, 0, 1 << 62)\n        seen, total = set(), 0\n\n        def walk(node, depth):\n            nonlocal total\n            if node is None:\n                return\n            # 先右后左：每个深度第一次到达的就是最靠右结点\n            if depth not in seen:\n                seen.add(depth)\n                total += node[0]\n            walk(node[2], depth + 1)\n            walk(node[1], depth + 1)\n\n        walk(tree, 0)\n        return total\n\n    for m in (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6):\n        for perm in permutations(range(1, m + 1)):\n            got, expect = run(list(perm)), brute(list(perm))\n            checked += 1\n            if got != expect:\n                fails += 1\n                print(f\"穷举不一致: {list(perm)} got={got} expect={expect}\")\n    for _ in range(400):\n        m = random.randint(7, 11)\n        perm = list(range(1, m + 1))\n        random.shuffle(perm)\n        got, expect = run(perm), brute(perm)\n        checked += 1\n        if got != expect:\n            fails += 1\n            print(f\"抽样不一致: {perm} got={got} expect={expect}\")\n    print(f\"对拍 {checked} 组: {'全部一致 ✓' if fails == 0 else f'{fails} 组不一致 ✗'}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1 and sys.argv[1] == \"--test\":\n        run_tests()\n    else:\n        solve()","method":"run","paramNames":["post"],"args":["[3, 8, 6, 12, 15, 10]"],"expected":"37","result":37,"events":[{"line":65,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10]},"depth":1},{"line":66,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6},"depth":1},{"line":69,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6},"depth":1},{"line":70,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1]},"depth":1},{"line":73,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"right":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1]},"depth":1},{"line":75,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"right":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"stack":[[10,0,4611686018427388000,5]]},"depth":1},{"line":76,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"right":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"stack":[[10,0,4611686018427388000,5]],"i":4},"depth":1},{"line":77,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"right":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"stack":[[10,0,4611686018427388000,5]],"i":4,"v":15},"depth":1},{"line":79,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"right":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"stack":[[10,0,4611686018427388000,5]],"i":4,"v":15},"depth":1},{"line":80,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"right":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"stack":[[10,0,4611686018427388000,5]],"i":4,"v":15,"val":10,"_lo":0,"hi":4611686018427388000,"p":5},"depth":1},{"line":82,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15,10],"m":6,"left":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"right":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1],"stack":[[10,0,4611686018427388000,5]],"i":4,"v":15,"val":10,"_lo":0,"hi":4611686018427388000,"p":5},"depth":1},{"line":83,"locals":{"post":[3,8,6,12,15